 "_comment": "Not a recording: the sleep screen's rotation rule (docs/design/lock-screen.md R4, R4b, F1, F4). At sleep (or a picture redraw): mode, X hours (0 = Every sleep), now (ms), the pool's cover ids in order (only covers on the device), whether a current book cover exists, and the state (the cover shown last, when it last changed, and Every sleep's show counts per id, absent = none). Every sleep's random draws are given in rand (each n -> 0..n-1, in the order drawn); advance false is a redraw of the same sleep. show: pool:<id>, current, default (the drawn \"Sleeping\" page) or off; next: the state after. batch: Every sleep's carry at a sync (R4b): the ready covers before (in order) with their show counts, carried on or retired (shown 3 times); xteink_fresh is the order an X4 sync tries new candidates in (not in the batch, not retired).",
